				<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-174f0a57 elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-invisible" data-id="174f0a57" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section" data-settings="{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;slideInUp&quot;}">
						<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
					<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-60e8f6e0" data-id="60e8f6e0" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3f7c749e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="3f7c749e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">El Cielo in Cozumel</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-644dee58 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="644dee58" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Enjoy this beautiful boat ride to the fullest, visiting the coasts of the Island and admiring its beautiful nature full of vegetation, if you are an expert in snorkeling then prepare your aquatic camera and explore every corner of these reefs that we are going to explore, we will find starfish, multicolored fish that will come to you to welcome you to its beautiful coral reefs that are part of the second largest barrier in the world and we have it in Mexico, if we have your luck we will be able to see manta rays, barracudas and more.</p><p>Our boats have a controlled capacity, in order to offer you a personalized service and enjoy the activity, we recommend that you reserve your place in advance.</p><p>Above ground or underwater, the magic and charm of Cozumel are everywhere: in the streets of San José, its center populated with traditional spirit, in its Mayan buildings and roads steeped in history, in its unforgiving and numerous coral reefs, and in its fabulous maritime reserves, where life manifests itself in the most diverse forms.</p>								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
					</div>
		</section>
